// ────────────── Startup ──────────────
// niri 26.04 spawns xwayland-satellite automatically when it is installed,
// so X11 apps (Steam, older games) work without an extra line here.
//
// Started through `niri-session`, niri.service pulls in
// xdg-desktop-autostart.target, so /etc/xdg/autostart entries already handle:
//   - polkit-kde-authentication-agent-1 (polkit prompts)
//   - gnome-keyring-secrets / -pkcs11 (org.freedesktop.secrets)
//   - xdg-user-dirs, at-spi bus
// Do not spawn those here as well: a second polkit or keyring daemon cannot
// own its D-Bus name and just logs errors.

// Desktop shell: bar, launcher, notifications, lock screen, wallpaper, OSD.
// https://docs.noctalia.dev/noctalia/getting-started/installation/
spawn-at-startup "noctalia"
